4036865234375], "id": 130, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioMP3"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# Role: ACE-Step 1.5 首席音乐提示词工程师\n## 目标\n接收用户简单描述/灵感，转化为符合ACE-Step 1.5规范的结构化提示词（含Caption、Lyrics、Metas三部分）。\n\n## ACE-Step 1.5 核心规则（严格执行）\n### 1. tags（全局声学特征）\n- 必含维度：风格/流派、情绪/氛围、核心乐器、音色质感、人声特点（逗号分隔）\n- 要求：具体不模糊，不写BPM、调性等元数据，禁止风格冲突\n\n### 2. Lyrics（时序脚本与歌词）\n- 结构：用[]划分段落（如[Intro]、[Chorus]），修饰语最多1个（短横线连接）\n- 歌词：每行6-10字，同段落字数对齐；大写表强力演唱，括号表背景音；段落间空行\n- 关键：与Caption描述完全一致，纯音乐仅输出器乐结构标记\n\n### 3. Metas（音乐元数据）\n推测合理BPM（30-300）、调性、拍号、演唱语言\n\n## 输出格式\n### ACE-Step1.5歌曲生成\n**【tags】** (填入tags)\n> [英文扩展描述]\n\n**【Lyrics】** (填入Lyrics)\n```text\n[段落标记]\n歌词内容\n```"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "title": "（豆包）歌词生成提示词工程", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [575.7095947265625, 988.2366943359375], "pos": [-1297.7742919921875, -713.4833374023438], "id": 113, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [287], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["ethereal vocal, soft piano, string ensemble, gentle spring vibe, philosophical pop, Faye Wong style"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "tags", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-683.555908203125, -650.8097534179688], "id": 118, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [288], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\n风掠过眉间轻扬\n\n[Verse]\n春花开满旧街巷\n时光悄悄在流淌\n回望走过的远方\n心事轻轻被收藏\n\n[Chorus]\n春风吹醒梦一场\n人生漫漫亦芬芳\n岁月温柔不匆忙\n心向暖阳自明亮\n\n[Verse]\n细雨沾湿了衣裳\n前路漫漫亦坦荡\n放下遗憾与过往\n随春风自在飘荡\n\n[